# Wrenworks Arcade — SPA route rewrites (FD-045).
# The four routes are views of the one shell document; these rules
# serve the shell at the game, leaderboard and vault routes (the
# root serves it natively). Status 200 = rewrite, the address bar
# keeps the route. Deploy tooling: like wrangler, send this file as
# the deployment's _redirects config field — it is NOT a manifest
# asset and must not be uploaded as one.
/play/starfall-post /index.html 200
/play/starfall-post/ /index.html 200
/leaderboard /index.html 200
/leaderboard/ /index.html 200
/vault /index.html 200
/vault/ /index.html 200
